Name "Latex_Extract(IF)"

--AE2联动的工业先锋(Industrial Foregoing)胶乳收集处理系统

--命名规则:
--Extractor: 胶乳提取机
--Latex_Processor: 胶乳处理器，用于制作干橡胶
--Latex_Dst: 胶乳缓存容器(Mekanism的终极流体储罐)
--Water: 水槽或者其他供水容器
--DryRubber_Dst: 干橡胶收集容器

--能量输送
Every 1 tick do

    Input FE:: From Energy_Src Top Side
        Output FE:: To each Extractor Bottom Side
        Output FE:: To each Latex_Processor Bottom Side
    forget

End

--胶乳抽取到缓存容器中
Every 20 ticks do

    Input fluid:industrialforegoing:latex From each Extractor Top Side Slots 0
        Output fluid:industrialforegoing:latex To Latex_Dst Bottom Side

End

--胶乳处理器进行水与胶乳处理，并保留缓存容器中的部分胶乳
Every 20 ticks do

    Input fluid:minecraft:water From Water Top Side
        Output fluid:minecraft:water To each Latex_Processor Bottom Side
    forget

    Input retain 240000 fluid:industrialforegoing:latex From Latex_Dst Top Side
        Output fluid:industrialforegoing:latex To each Latex_Processor Bottom Side
    forget

End

--干橡胶输出到缓存物品容器中
Every 20 ticks do

    Input industrialforegoing:dryrubber From each Latex_Processor Top Side Slots 2-10
        Output industrialforegoing:dryrubber To DryRubber_Dst Bottom Side
    forget

End